{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1325,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8234a44ac7b398ff1d99573",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每到春天就觉得感动……\r\n没错！这就是！\r\n我被选为！班长的季节啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d152677bf21175881c8eba4c5c60f5928b3b1385871fa71666604e9996eaa21d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45e8eafe293823f6f502aaaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说吃西瓜有沾盐派、\r\n沾糖派等各种吃法……\r\n但我是立刻吃掉派！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa18c1973a1e6d1f3d663e64253ed11de8e3c6476b48a79a970ca0d17a36c856",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b2b914a811511b3326c3c08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节有圣蹄祭等很多的活动。\r\n也就是说……\r\n是展现班长实力的时候！诶嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d32fe42b9f4fb9784f1e018dc794427c5e10f3041cfe6514e27e8350f784bc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aaf464204417909f1c1311c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷的时候就看着我的笑容吧。\r\n这是母亲赞不绝口地说\r\n看了就会觉得温暖的笑容……嘻嘻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91aafe22973b18f8aba511e7cbfb643dd24e9e17ebc061e171ac16475c68fa27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58cf8602cafa82609ef8e246",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n来，我们去练习吧！\r\n跳跃！然后攻击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61c9ce0c72622a64e8b865f99b96825ab565a6fbca7243775e1608fbb1337f55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac450c1badc73a8d1a199c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵！高高凌空飞舞，带头\r\n迈向胜利！我做了这样的梦！\r\n那一定是会成真的梦准没错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac9f81c1b67085c60591602a05f7a293d754414b43eb7509235967a7aec329a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1f7ed95c1043e718fb9a56e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「吃饭要慢慢咀嚼再吞下去！」\r\n我想出了一句很棒的格言！\r\n得去告诉千代王同学！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b41bc16eb3bb0aa5e33fabc9a74b342e9e1abf32bb0939d6c6585768ecde3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ebdcea4fc3f8e986d59750",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到米浴同学在吃爆大碗白饭，\r\n我就想跟着点来挑战看看，\r\n没想到比想象中还……嗝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c54e2f77df34be15011216eee30834b4ff554f081a22c288ad650838da1b9a37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:545d02c362b6c1ae1ec1d492",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚就是储备干劲的时候！\r\n来，做个爆进体操之后，\r\n今天也要精神百倍地睡觉喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "381716f8d1316694f6af20f6b809944795a2b3d6ef0259de457e43286009b274",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d45b3bac92d5057eb8c4df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的练习真辛苦……！\r\n今晚应该能早点入睡……呼噜。\r\n……啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbf4b729df7585f4956fae77d6ca4fbe71f601d91282da29c30440fca0d2c8f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8870aae864a1da5c5e60b6d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又到了春季感谢祭的季节！\r\n樱花布贴都在蠢蠢欲动了！\r\n爆进力量不断涌出来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d80c5431525355ae30b61957319197f6d4141e4c95a7c176614d7d7c59f73e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76412ab15ffb3add654178e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套洋装凉爽极了！\r\n如果爆进就会更凉快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13a50420a0ce7a238a371a3677ba9adec560f9665d6aaa08ba46ea8b31af3330",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c22f48885382ef70e09534b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，我发现了！假如我现在跑到\r\n开满枫叶的山里玩捉迷藏……\r\n不就会没人找得到我吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9159722ded45d5d48fcf39b8d8aed72c9c4f1a0511d6e2ebd604892cdcaf858",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:270fbac2174433da20eade92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为班长，我的内心随时\r\n都在爆进！地熊熊燃烧着，\r\n绝对不会觉得冷……哈啾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8462e4e91f79b973f08e278481c5b0d3e5321dae494f595a682254a867d7485f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34d6fb2ebfcf300445c3a99c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d88607ac53947b20eaebe796600a27f5aadfbc71c313b50e2b907e12411fbec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1c151c6a49a769dfaa8792e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d88607ac53947b20eaebe796600a27f5aadfbc71c313b50e2b907e12411fbec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4dd2bd1c443dfadccef4b75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的学园也毫无异常！\r\n我跟微光同学一起巡逻过了，\r\n请放心吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e4a79ef26d16aa8df31a1d8432f884c00068bfd7561784bc4e8a98b0a8e45a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b187853e7ce6a2eb2de359f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让班上团结的秘诀吗？\r\n那当然是……\r\n要有一位优秀的班长呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15d383c9326d81abffecfc20b66fafda2f236e8be29aa524294236cef0e6042d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f33b9826dc44c04ddf7c332e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔给予奖励也是很重要的。\r\n所以我都会自己称赞自己。\r\n摸摸头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "290c614d197e729e43b0c49bd1dc9f2f540586846bb8482b1f3f39b1fb1f79a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c72fff5cddd9d928933d1ea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到波旁同学和米浴同学\r\n每天努力的模样，令我十分欣慰！\r\n两位都是一百分！满分！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d30b0c23746e13f839c18ee1fdd522abca1608dd1bcc82a070d5d6c95ff668cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04e8e6b2de61af174bfc1e2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……训练员您也说些什么吧！\r\n我被这样默默盯着看……\r\n就会觉得浑身不自在啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fb77af3ab90a7e23c8bc435a26c08973bb0fa94f3ab178b9dd87a1d6382c934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7808612a06bd2b4e1eddf0b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没错，我就是完美的！\r\n看我一分钟之内跳完\r\n三分钟的舞步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f54708a9f72e746824715e747f1af9310bcf13f1df3bfe99bb474ccc7bc864",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2c8cd0fbdf52d0c810ef034",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我暂时就穿这样过日子吧！\r\n因为这衣服很难脱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "611026280f1ebaa879921c69a074e4ea99bf7fa7bef693edd6098b1d528eddbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1251e0dcabdda35ecfea40b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会辜负大家对我的期望，\r\n我们一起努力，让大家看到\r\n我盛开成最耀眼、最大朵的樱花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2e1a49efe5715faabd0b7a4cc9be98a95fc64392aa8dcfbacd97037c55e3208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd65b2f63c2dd5620d95855",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会在各种比赛中拿下胜利给您看！\r\n这才是班长该有的样子！没错！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e30e060b3f610bf35a3c88b1a26f272024de62c0e0bbc68646f134b5a541f077",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9bc930cca7ef0a1f2589d87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近上学的时候常常遇到小花同学。\r\n因为我们都是坚强独立的人，\r\n所以互相吸引了是吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56898ce543d44abeffc250e4478e152a244391ca5e5704669d554c3d1dbbe5fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08d5e07c71d3a68b669eea16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您问我上午考试的结果啊？\r\n哈哈，别担心，\r\n我很快就会搞定课后辅导的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ebb53b1bc262f7d9b03a722a2475ff1260614f76fca0b7449bec926962de7db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cae7130b63d874445bf5793a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フフーン…誉れ高き学級委員長に\r\n挑みますか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "217a39dd8457faf77674be4b2e291890fa76d7a97c4360d0bf08db264f4617c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b770ebaec162a3fd06f8346",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我两分钟就写完作业了！\r\n就算不看题目，对我来说这也只是\r\n早餐前小试身手！虽然现在是晚上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bbb303e009e75f0ad3a7730b85b37220142652614e2ba1ffb9bff26772a2336",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bb91b355ac17d89f4f60221",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "母亲做的樱饼是非常非常好吃的！\r\n我会继续主张应该要加入小卖部商品\r\n才对的看法！……流口水了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b06c86c333f4f34ac9e488dce2d3fa1b93373e45088febb6018f74aaaafa9de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b2f90f1203b42a1418d24f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气再热也不能露出狼狈的样子！\r\n身为班长，可不能让崇拜我的\r\n学生们失望！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6293b58c1b3c0c2934bd462d57894106fda7229f509ad3bc5dd9e4d571119f5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e44dd136cf7305265ae1067e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时期我都会利用月光来念书。\r\n因为我听说优等生都会这么做。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aa712d64136eb91065b73f3a9c6fa096253d9d0e9e5df98f9d59522297750ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cef70b5560332551a36e22ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再冷我也绝不穿厚重的衣服！\r\n因为这样比较轻盈，才能跑比较快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c04cdcc6a865833d526bf9297552c44121cbcd3fe5de2877ca0a294c13cbd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d29a975dbb3e3f69b6c364d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我鞋子上的樱花布贴\r\n和桂冠同学是同一款的！\r\n怎么样，很棒吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af0eccdc15f3e566cb8db20e9d508fc5fc9f187e0fd6d0efa3a7000d4e3bd6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760b9d4d6c14e1c59cbfd2c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我常常和波旁同学一起去\r\n自动贩卖机买饮料喝，所以\r\n我很清楚她喜欢喝什么果汁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c34439168cab919421c9dace54dbd6ce3fda833e1954f8c97319f504b556d38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deaee2dcb2a022f8a95733cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诗歌剧同学真是太棒了！\r\n毅力及韧性都相当出类拔萃！\r\n今年的班长奖是她的了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94e3543881f0c3998b438a46a16330e1466de5a7a88cdac8f84e8576cfb8fde8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7410a39cbeb7fe9cfcdbc1da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生野同学的包包有魔法！\r\n无论是绷带或消毒药水，\r\n任何医疗用品她都能瞬间拿出来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6d32b06550f6af53971e9474535999f9dfc5de24bfe7a4f1985259bcdfbd826",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ece911391131f0084b187a99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动会那天，父亲和母亲\r\n送了我一个特制奖章！\r\n闪亮亮的很帅气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "845eeb559748eb1e5aa72594cf4cdf5bdf525aed51b21a2f1cb43596a23c080d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46925e3969d4e4bd7846e68c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早上我花了一点工夫准备！\r\n因为我的手不习惯绑辫子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2322beb039ee3071c0f9236c408ce069eabc3c676e099545b0abb92811a2d23d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36799fcb54cf80c58eea5b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐要吃什么好呢？\r\n我现在有股莫名想吃西红柿意大利面，\r\n或是西红柿酱炒饭的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0083c2c142fe65fe594d314d0e8d4bfd467092003ec1012ac685237be8055f5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd927eceb6aa7dd1a955fc4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上练跑也能放心！\r\n腰带上的星星这么耀眼，\r\n一定会替我照亮夜晚的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcb5bd6e3693d11c08b92000ef56b69414a88b620aaafde4dab2b0b0736b533e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac2b4b4f37ec32db3eff836d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到春天，就是在感谢祭上让新生\r\n看到我这个班长活跃的好机会！\r\n来，看我大展身手吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c2137270d5a70e821792cd5f043275253a89cf1ff994781f8293e52e8615831",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dac8a878f552bca03fd7a88b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是到海边或山上，这个颜色\r\n都很醒目！不会找不到班长，\r\n大家想必很放心吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5d8670ccd2ef54f86cad0cdf812f9cb10bcf3f5d4512015ea9d9c8f8b65ef7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f394b30bd2e8875a67e6e12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不觉得一旦绑上一字巾\r\n就会想运动吗！我会！！\r\n而且是非常想！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da6ccade0b7e7d1836c25e84ed9b18d455589f3f081b78181153f57896255e9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f65e389bf8b0e5c208bebc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "班上同学送我肚围当慰劳品。\r\n我真不愧是班长，\r\n声望无远弗届！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a450c2666d1d484046beaa9e4716208cd5667670e1db196caf3dc747916d1d7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93980144d660a3822ae2149f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接住！丢出！奔跑！\r\n然后相信我！如此一来，\r\n一定会获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc6568a4eb6ff631f0aca433b0f9645725375d0997d062123bf3272217ba234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0126c03b5789655696bc6bd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "躲避球在胜利俱乐部里\r\n也很受欢迎！我的必杀技？\r\n就是「爆进攻击」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1300cf1dd92cb63dd408ee248b0d7161b4c26f81793be9065defaeb26fe04ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1419e841e918aa017f9477d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "长距离也难不倒我的！\r\n总有一天我一定会变得擅长的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4901eb215f7b56d7a5f502b22cc5af1215018a8084ccc7dc52b3e0272b9922f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76068fa298f8b7c1d3ab3539",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a34644b2b48d180e3c7919e4a8c911e526b266d3d0e4f60948bf09a0677d7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56f8f98d6f4b81af16a3ff54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢晴天！\r\n原因是很好跑！\r\n报告内容如上！嗯哼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be1ea27b626087cb9caf9f8b50ae71d43f0281a192f5275da21d3d8b6589a41f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1716de7dde044d5e0984b048",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速度！爆发力！班长！\r\n集这三点于一身的我，\r\n该先增进哪方面呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c3a6081dbf167485bca9e5ddbc45d04a4366e8e312313965c366326cdb993c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27610994af952f70f4489d0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爆进！到了训练的时间了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89aea97271d0c7869f75e277793a468b6537e2538934b829c58f4c973ffa187f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e07ab6e43f701378d811f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好要成为大家的楷模了！\r\n因为我可是班长啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3590fdfcf445fd8d1558e2ea272ac661f90f1837d5ef8b437fab8de1603163fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d4cfff76a06cd14e39f1f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要训练员和我一起合作，\r\n无论是多艰难的训练，\r\n我都能轻～松克服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86684cccf5472c365df95d6af462f322eb19915e54f936a9268feaa8d0de7918",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce56aae15da00618274c852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在抵达尚未有人到达的纪录前\r\n我不会停下脚步的！\r\n爆进、爆进──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0df840b0d62a0ff882f3bb5ee3441ebe3bd45b46f906c2e03c4863204e673ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36fcdf1bd7a9b4a206f7140e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为班长！我一定会\r\n诚心诚意地好好努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa82c62d7a1d0e1b8d79f6b5fbacac8f7cd109fb73abc202fd0d4aa6e1ad86b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0888ecad670f0cf2382f65d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绑好一字巾，干劲也十足！\r\n我要去卖力──地跑步啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e98cab0fc9eb78ce35b4de8e90275e760e73ddc0c2aed519172df3d987ab2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:323a5112bfac1831ba5a53b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "换上这身打扮，\r\n让我觉得跳跃力变强了！\r\n我跳！我跳──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "174113b5900c7ba48f847538440517152af1a786f7fe531e42183f73c2afb856",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a423cad9cb30126d912b023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔鬼躲避球跟比赛的道理都一样！\r\n相信我就一定能赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "745ec8dfb2e06cbe0de8dd3e1e7d26fbecbcba9eb54a56a423cee4ca6532fe44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc6fc7697d18cdbd0fa2e4cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "内心和服装都有熊熊燃烧的热情！\r\n这就是班长！\r\n爆进爆进──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8f88fc60fb70251564f2fa4b8f14157fd6c8128c57e658197003b7800433255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41d7fab693fca8c12f813f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要我们通力合作，\r\n就一定能抓住胜利！\r\n我这个班长说的准没错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca3fee15f7794c9d138349cbff8085af01dedf89f549544950c8898ee31959f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f0f3944c875bbde593153b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辫子的结松掉了！\r\n训练员，我先把头发解开，\r\n麻烦你帮我重新绑好了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23ef4555aece113f30043e5bfbd4f6dbd6ebd9cc1586b6bb0edaac41b0180c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d4457cb33e9456c619d1f5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我们走吧！\r\n请你尽管放心相信我！\r\n因为我也信任我们俩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7278768b6d0fd24b7d86ca44a8b43b5aea2d329b7be608aaed362b48f2bfcc78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4411234352e352dbe7fe9fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和您一起养大的盛开的樱花，是绝不会凋零的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7efeca39c1a0acabe88957e4233ced90b5bb75f4bb22b22b33a19ae4d90bbba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0e5559ac68e19517520746f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，大家都要继续怀抱理想啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3cac2442abd230d1f57198bebcd66e8a466e4887a0b020ffa3b5b9e665da9db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3637f0243d7bd8b64edf2732",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我们合作获得的胜利！没错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d07ce740588fc7231a01c1808dd885ce79308d0a86fd4ca68d643034accbafb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53d48d9d0bf67d9bd8450126",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连我自己都觉得这个结果太棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2233947a27b5367a9932549965b94c4ef80d3a834c0e6245c0df06db210ef983",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c90ef8c560b795417355839f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来我又要变得更快了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d80db2714165f25436eab6eca267d419f10d0329994069867dfa14766cb13a7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfbedb065339ada2bda49fc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请赐我能赢过任何班长的力量……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "013703367f04f365ec612dacf364238d12b7ffe92a810faa703ee46b35672df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:293e2bb6f1d696845a0e716d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我叫樱花进王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca67650af413f7ffb4ded2effcbe7c26f46e1b5d9ade1038b8b8cc499eae16c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c89f36d83bcd616934e60b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支持，我也会优秀地完成！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebed672cbcaf02d785118f7a2b1be61ff022377af6fa5d5996257ed1d2c2773e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3074173053243645ac1f30e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有班长在您身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed31bdc94371aef9e9ed870767c7718f30a178455460f9d42f9f3249881bd955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fd8f2bfdb2caebb56aee3d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这个班长……无懈可击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dd59060374c11f25efca36b82847df4a357c22ed14666adff6603ba5e4c0e16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad205ee4e5c0c8b7c5a21e3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爆进──！\r\n由我来带头迈向胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aab3e0751ecc82c0ac9fb4d1306f26032bbbb6e3ea6811863dc6b3f5e57adc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63ae65be3bd846c29815f6e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来带头迈向胜利吧！\r\n因为我可是班长嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d682700b443b3663cf37a3ca618273afc0be344f39a4bb13869f351b2558441c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd9cc29db25d1204badc0ff2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是樱花进王！\r\n我们一起掌握胜利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e978a928091448d51a3f34f7f5535234ebfe047463caaa3013a3bc4b412f2cae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb8d64b662f5b51ec8d97d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3604c1adac25be66b4ba8176bee9bbe87caf466c0729f619139ebf88d882bb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b285fba5d661dcf3e079baf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够找到你这颗独一无二的珍珠……\r\n真是最棒的experience！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a71ff245086c3cc8ca71dd366fd07e4e1456ca4a760f546a7d942d1a61ad2c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:307f69e5e04078661c4ba3ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e42824481b89139758cebcbc6de379bc2bfe391af6bc5931ce02cac1bdb2432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5cad2c75dd81904ca2952c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54290808a3e3c1b396c2e16f2fb30f6867b432b72e872ca49eb13fcaa3e944b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "100001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
